[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2047.14, "timestamp": "00:34:07", "text": "いい顔してるね。それは何ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2049.75, "timestamp": "00:34:09", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2051.829, "timestamp": "00:34:11", "text": "えっと、壮大なオリジナルコンテンツ。ボス戦は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2054.95, "timestamp": "00:34:14", "text": "かなり高いですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2057.109, "timestamp": "00:34:17", "text": "なぜあなたは中年のような味覚を持っているのですか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2069.03, "timestamp": "00:34:29", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2072.389, "timestamp": "00:34:32", "text": "もし私だったら、もちろん愛するだろう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2074.55, "timestamp": "00:34:34", "text": "のように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2077.829, "timestamp": "00:34:37", "text": "いいえ、それはしません。私はダンジョンが好きです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2096.47, "timestamp": "00:34:56", "text": "行く。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2099.75, "timestamp": "00:34:59", "text": "[音楽]"}]